+ Return an empty collection instead of null
- Return -1
- Throw an exception
- Return dynamic
> Empty collections are simpler for callers than null.
? mcq: Which command automatically applies many lint and migration fixes?
- dart run
+ dart fix --apply
- dart pub get
- dart compile
> dart fix applies automated fixes suggested by the analyzer.
